Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.90,OP,,0,0,0,,好胜其实是认真的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.57,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算这么说 你也不会相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:10.11,OP,,0,0,0,,所谓的常识 有时只是枷锁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.82,OP,,0,0,0,,正因为未知 才更值得去挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:15.41,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士 还是路边的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:17.91,OP,,0,0,0,,为了找到答案 我选择迎战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:23.21,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃烧的热情如闪电般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:28.80,OP,,0,0,0,,无论你变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:33.09,OP,,0,0,0,,并肩作战的意志绝不动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:37.93,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:43.18,OP,,0,0,0,,只为遇见令人热血沸腾的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:50.07,OP,,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀锋指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:55.24,OP,,0,0,0,,唤醒内心温柔的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:03:00.12,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸腾燃烧的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:04.54,OP,,0,0,0,,将绝望的气息一刀斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.46,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0 300)}用这把“真剑”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:28.12,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷电击中 内心翻腾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:36.04,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的预感 第一次在心底悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.63,ED,,0,0,0,,努力过后的冰淇淋奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.68,ED,,0,0,0,,在特别的日子里分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.55,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此摆出美味的神情对视
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.64,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.48,ED,,0,0,0,,这些闪闪发光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.61,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:03.74,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在许愿 像是在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:07.45,ED,,0,0,0,,细细地品味每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:11.37,ED,,0,0,0,,在朴素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地点缀色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:19.38,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法 离不开你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.22,ED,,0,0,0,,这股让人无法抗拒的悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那颗珠子就交给你保管了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一直都放在身边吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我也学会了新招式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸 决胜负吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再见咯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事的话 就给我爬过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我会亲自奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刃 快抓好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 长竹竿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是哪里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加 你振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大事不妙 她喝下太多水了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生 赶快进行人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是人工呼吸?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴对嘴把气吹进去 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以这么做吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 不然会来不及
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛耶 干嘛打我?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还敢说我 你刚才是不是想亲我?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是亲 是人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还敢说这种话 你这个色鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是不是有什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 这里是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是在城里面才对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏他们呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在掉下来的时候分散了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,希望大家都平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看来没办法回到上面去了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这里到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(烤鸡串)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎么了呱?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有...有怪物呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我怪物也太失礼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鬼丸四天王其中一人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,灯笼鮟鱇烤鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,奉鬼丸大人的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你们全都吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你刚才掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要是害在下这张帅脸受伤\N你要怎么赔?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那样说不定反而更像个美男子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有精神是件好事 不错唷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还不快现身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里啊 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是猴子吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别看我这样 我可是鬼丸四天王之一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,比钢铁还要坚硬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,比子弹还要迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,高楼大厦也能一跃而过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,超级猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真会在那边耍嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 你们也报上名来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那就说给你听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,古今无双
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天下第一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让哭闹儿童安静的风云人物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,宫本武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,佐佐木小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,正是在下本人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在下的台词吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,厚颜无耻!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,竟敢自称古今无双\N有没有把在下看在眼里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这两人竟然是我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,连打发时间都嫌无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还真敢说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么怪力?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别大意了 小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}在下原本的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}是获得雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}现在跟那家伙合作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,当场把武藏除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或许更容易获得想要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然把我们丢到这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,吾辈乃鬼丸四天王之一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,变色龙拿破仑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果乖乖交出雷神剑和雷神珠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那就姑且饶你们一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事就来抢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让你见识我的新招威力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吾辈的字典里没有“不可能”三个字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,无珠雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还不赶快把手放开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,又消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们站在一旁别动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他在寻找敌人的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.63,0:09:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是...是替身?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,暴雨斩!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 一直在那边躲来躲去的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吾辈可不是那种会上这种当的...\N- 蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,糟...糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好 上钩了 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 让我浪费这么多力气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我安分一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刃 你不可以放开他哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你...你是我?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你...你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的是你吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎么一模一样?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,原来他还能变身吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看招...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你还看不出来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那个蠢蛋才是假货
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是假货吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你这假货是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,500乘以1000是多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,500乘以1000?50万
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,五亿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 是50万啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然会算错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛耶 干嘛要打我?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算外表可以模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但你模仿不了脑袋里的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是假货
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为刃根本不可能会答对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖就范吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生 把我丢出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,海参踢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吃我这招
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你踢歪了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,无珠雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电斩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是个麻烦的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人该不会也...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶快会合才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺会玩些有趣的把戏嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,光看那外表 没想到竟然这么强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在下一直在等待这个时机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在下的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,打从一开始就不是击退鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而是获得雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,成为天下第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,起内讧了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你终究只是僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是身体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,连心灵也腐烂了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用卑鄙的手段取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不打算靠自己的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而是仰赖雷神剑的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为靠那种方式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就能成为天下第一的武士吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,耍卑鄙可是你最拿手的伎俩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,混账
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你就到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏 你觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在 武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没...没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,进行得很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,完全按照在下的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,作战?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要骗敌人的话 就得先骗自己人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不都这么说吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}算了 这次就当作是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,影...影虎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你们也乖乖认命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呱...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那...那是我重要的提灯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快把提灯还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你们知道我的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,无珠雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电斩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,得...得救了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们三个都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这...这到底是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刃不是懂一点动物的语言吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙原本是一直追着我们的大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,刃后来发现他只是想回丛林老家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只要他肯带我们来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刃就会告诉他回家的路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你带路咯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的故乡就在那个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他们挺有一手的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧 蜘蛛男
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的四天王该出击了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人欲罢不能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王还剩最后一只
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能轻松搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}还不能太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}他们说不定还设了其他陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 大家快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沙...沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,动作不要慢吞吞的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刃...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,珠...珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,两个蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是让你们闹的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好...好大一只乌龟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙就是鬼丸四天王最后一人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟号
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 蜘蛛男!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要攻击咯 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟号有着500万马力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可别太小看他哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟车轮!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快...快逃!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙跑到哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才超危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,雷神剑差点就被压烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,已经爬不起来了是不是啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看我趁现在砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,变形
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是乌龟号蜘蛛型态
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛拉Z
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看我踩扁你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,做好觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看你做了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,被你弄到脚都缠在一起了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,知道厉害了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你活该 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你可终于来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼...鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我等到都不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刃和鬼丸决胜负的时刻终于到来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.15,0:23:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不要输给鬼丸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 雷神剑vs风神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我一定要打倒你 鬼丸
